            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.61

- Added reliable support for switching playback between multiple YouTube Music tabs.
- When the current tab pauses, Now rescans all music tabs and follows the one that is actively playing.
- Playback controls and queue artwork remain bound to the newly selected music tab.
]]></description>
