            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.59

- Fixed the overlay sometimes remaining hidden when YouTube Music starts playing.
- Removed a visibility race that could read the previous paused state during a fresh playback update.
- Prevented the internal “Nothing playing” placeholder from being treated as a real track.
]]></description>
